  "instance_name": "meme_formatting_convention",
  "label": "Meme formatting convention: Text overlay on actor image",
  "description": "The meme follows a common internet meme format where a well-known actor or public figure is used as a visual anchor for a text-based message. This format relies on the viewer's recognition of the actor and their public persona to deliver the message. The use of Denzel Washington in this format is a key element of the meme's effectiveness, as his authoritative image contrasts with the message about vocalness and weakness.",
